"_O_V_E_R_V_I_E_W.txt" Commented List of all files for FastCat, with one line descriptions.
"build.xml" Complex ANT build script for FastCat
"desc.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for project files
"descother.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for non-project files
"DESCRIPT.ION" TCC file descriptions
"descript0.ion" generated file of overriding descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"descript2.ion" generated file default descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"DummyString.class" compiled Java byte code
"DummyString.java" Model for how to add new constructor to String
"FastCat.class" FastCat main Java program compiled byte code
"fastcat.icon128.png" roughly 128x128 icon for the FastCat project
"fastcat.icon16.png" 16x16 icon for the FastCat project
"fastcat.icon32.png" 32x32 icon for the FastCat project
"fastcat.icon48.png" roughly 48x48 icon for the FastCat project
"fastcat.icon64.png" roughly 64x64 icon for the FastCat project
"fastcat.jar" jarred class files: Streamlined Replacement for StringBuilder
"FastCat.java" main Java program source
"fastcat.look" uncommented jar manifest
"fastcat.screenshot.png" screenshot for the FastCat project
"fastcat.use" precis(summary) Streamlined Replacement for StringBuilder Generated
"fastcat.xml" ASP PAD desc of the FastCat project: Streamlined Replacement for StringBuilder
"fastcat24.zip" FastCat 2.4 distribute zip: Streamlined Replacement for StringBuilder
"grab.btm" copy in Java source code from IntelliJ and build it. Roedy's use only.
"j18.txt" marker to indicate that Java compiler target version 1.8 needed.
"jdisplay.css" cascading style sheet for displaying source code in HTML
"MasterDistribution.site" URL to find the master copy of the FastCat project files
"mindprod.css" cascading style sheet for general HTML
"rebuild.xml" Simplified ANT build script for FastCat
"untouch.digest" generated: enables untouching (set date back) unchanged but redated files.
"use.txt" key facts about the FastCat project. Generates fastcat.use
"version.txt" key current version info about the FastCat project. Generates fastcat.use
"versionhistory.txt" complete version history of the FastCat project. Generates fastcat.use
"zip.look" uncommented zip manifest for fastcat24.zip
